響き鳴り渡れ希望の音
resonate and ring out, sound of hope!

538
00:58:10,789 --> 00:58:13,989
「信ずる事を諦めない」と
Chant, "I won't give up on believing!"

539
00:58:13,989 --> 00:58:14,789
唄え
Sing!

540
00:58:14,789 --> 00:58:16,289
可能性に
In possibilities...

541
00:58:16,289 --> 00:58:17,189
ゼロはない
...there is no zero!

542
00:58:17,189 --> 00:58:17,989
飛べよ
Fly!

543
00:58:17,989 --> 00:58:18,989
この
Upon this...

544
00:58:18,989 --> 00:58:19,989
奇跡に
...miracle...

545
00:58:19,989 --> 00:58:22,689
光あれ
...let there be light!

546
00:58:28,189 --> 00:58:31,989
切り裂け まだ見ぬ日に行く為に
Slice through to march toward days yet unseen!

547
00:58:31,989 --> 00:58:35,189
不可能なんて何一つない
There is nothing impossible!

548
00:58:35,189 --> 00:58:38,389
こんなに心強い事はない
Nothing could be more reassuring than this!

549
00:58:38,389 --> 00:58:39,189
絶対
Absolutely...

550
00:58:39,189 --> 00:58:39,989
絶対
...definitely...

551
00:58:39,989 --> 00:58:41,389
絶対信じ合い
...believing in each other...

552
00:58:41,389 --> 00:58:44,389
ぶっちぎる
...we'll break straight through!

553
00:58:44,389 --> 00:58:47,689
例え闇に吸い込まれそうになって
Even if we feel like being swallowed by darkness,

554
00:58:47,689 --> 00:58:51,189
涙さえも血に濡れて苦しくっても
and even if tears are soaked in blood and painful,

555
00:58:51,189 --> 00:58:53,989
帰る場所が待っている
the place to return to is waiting!

556
00:58:53,989 --> 00:58:54,989
集え
Gather!

557
00:58:54,989 --> 00:58:55,989
守れ
Protect!

558
00:58:55,989 --> 00:58:56,989
契れ
Pledge!

559
00:58:56,989 --> 00:58:59,389
勇気の結晶が
The crystal of courage...

560
00:58:59,389 --> 00:59:02,689
奇跡なんだ
...is a miracle!

561
00:59:02,989 --> 00:59:06,189
願い、祈り、すべてを背負い
Carrying wishes and prayers, carrying everything,

562
00:59:06,189 --> 00:59:09,389
本気を超えた本気の歌
a song of seriousness surpassing true effort!

563
00:59:09,389 --> 00:59:12,689
痛みなんて何も怖くない
I'm not afraid of pain at all!

564
00:59:12,689 --> 00:59:13,389
滾れ
Surge!

565
00:59:13,389 --> 00:59:14,289
沸騰せよ
Boil up!

566
00:59:14,289 --> 00:59:15,189
この体
This body...

567
00:59:15,189 --> 00:59:16,189
穿て
Pierce through!

568
00:59:16,189 --> 00:59:16,989
さあ
Now...

569
00:59:16,989 --> 00:59:17,789
闇夜に
...into the dark night...

570
00:59:17,789 --> 00:59:19,189
稲妻を
...strike lightning!

571
00:59:36,689 --> 00:59:39,989
出会い笑い合い相手そして泣きじゃくり
Meeting, laughing together, and sobbing,

572
00:59:39,989 --> 00:59:43,289
命の炎も一緒に燃やして
burning the flame of life together,

573
00:59:43,289 --> 00:59:46,389
五感の全部が叫ぶ
all of my five senses cry out!

574
00:59:46,389 --> 00:59:47,189
愛と
So much...

575
00:59:47,189 --> 00:59:48,189
呼べる
...that it can...

576
00:59:48,189 --> 00:59:49,189
ほどの
...be called love,

577
00:59:49,189 --> 00:59:52,189
眩しく煌めいた
a dazzlingly sparkling...

578
00:59:52,189 --> 00:59:55,689
友の証
...proof of friendship!

579
00:59:56,989 --> 01:00:00,189
絆、心、一つに束ね
Unite our bonds and hearts as one...

580
01:00:00,244 --> 01:00:00,944
響き
Resonate...

581
01:00:00,944 --> 01:00:02,344
響き渡れ 希望の音
Resonate far and wide, sound of hope!

582
01:00:02,344 --> 01:00:05,144
「信ずることを諦めない」と
"Never give up on believing,"

583
01:00:05,144 --> 01:00:06,744
唄え
sing out!

584
01:00:06,744 --> 01:00:08,344
可能性に
In possibilities,

585
01:00:08,344 --> 01:00:09,744
ゼロはない
there is no zero.

586
01:00:09,744 --> 01:00:11,144
飛べよ
Soar high,

587
01:00:11,144 --> 01:00:13,444
この奇跡に光あれ
let there be light upon this miracle!

588
01:01:03,544 --> 01:01:05,744
ハマードリゾートへようこそ！
Welcome to Hamado Resort!

589
01:01:05,744 --> 01:01:08,744
バシバシバシバシ！ワシが行く！
Splash, splash, splash, splash! Here I go!

590
01:01:10,744 --> 01:01:13,744
ハマードとはワシのことだ！
Hamado is none other than me!

591
01:01:14,244 --> 01:01:17,044
みんなライブを見てくれてありぺこー！
Thank you all for watching the live stream, peko!

592
01:01:17,044 --> 01:01:19,144
このあと10時15分より...
Starting after this at 10:15...

593
01:01:19,144 --> 01:01:22,744
メンバーシップ限定アンコールLIVEがあるぺこ！
there'll be a members-only encore live, peko!

594
01:01:22,744 --> 01:01:25,744
まだまだぺこらの新衣装見たいぺこだよね！
You still want to see more of Pekora's new outfit, right peko?

595
01:01:25,744 --> 01:01:30,244
ぺこらも歌も歌いたいし、みんなに新衣装もっと見てほしい！
Pekora wants to sing more songs too, and I want everyone to see more of my new outfit!

596
01:01:30,244 --> 01:01:33,044
なので是非とも遊びに来てぺこ！
So please come on over and hang out, peko!

597
01:01:33,044 --> 01:01:35,244
